<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Xanadu</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Founded in 2016, Xanadu is a Canadian photonic
quantum computing company with the mission to build quantum computers that are useful and available to people everywhere. Xanadu is building
fault-tolerant quantum computers using light, with systems designed to compute at room temperature. Xanadu develops both hardware and
software, including PennyLane, its open-source quantum computing platform. Xanadu is the first pure-play photonic quantum computing company
to list on public markets (Nasdaq/TSX: XNDU) and is recognized globally for its breakthroughs in scalable quantum technologies. Visit
xanadu.ai or follow on X @XanaduAI.</P>

